{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫劇集《非份之罪》單元《危險遊戲》20日播出一集，羅冠蘭飾演的清潔工潔清，與女兒曉善（江嘉敏飾）之間的溫馨母女情成為焦點。隨著真相揭開，潔清得知當初害女兒雙腳癱瘓的罪魁禍首，竟是自己一直打工的老闆危家仁（吳偉豪飾），羅冠蘭將震驚、痛心轉化為兇狠的「變臉式」演技，獲網民一致讚賞。</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">劇中，潔清一心為女兒着想，得知曉善與男友分手後，心痛女兒當初因相信男友承諾而搬出同居，豈料卻落得如斯下場。曉善最終向母親揭露真相，指當年<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">當年導致她雙腳癱瘓要坐輪椅的始作俑者</span>正是家仁。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"42a0efe0-ad49-4e2c-9ea2-f81d081e3939.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20261cQcDuk8Wh1784601473.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"42a0efe0-ad49-4e2c-9ea2-f81d081e3939.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"50984bfc-f27e-462a-8d13-0da1016d5a5f.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026wyAG7Y1J4K1784601479.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"50984bfc-f27e-462a-8d13-0da1016d5a5f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">潔清聽聞真相後，從起初的難以置信，瞬間轉為極度憤怒，咬牙切齒地怒罵：「危家仁你呢個打靶仔！」這短短一幕，羅冠蘭將潔清對女兒的憐惜，以及對仇人的恨意展現得淋漓盡致。隨後，她轉向安慰曉善，眼眶泛紅地勸女兒搬回家中居住，表示：「阿媽仲後生咩，我仲可以煮多幾餐飯畀你食，好好咁照顧我個寶貝女，多一日得一日，咁我就心滿意足㗎啦。」細膩情感令人動容。</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">羅冠蘭的演出再度引起熱烈討論。不少網民認為潔清作為曉善的母親，擁有極強的復仇動機，紛紛留言猜測她是殺死吳偉豪的真兇：「Big Boss 仲唔係清姐？」、「清姐好大殺人動機」、「羅冠蘭啲演技真係冇得輸，好想睇多啲佢做戲」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T04:58:14.230509+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":515,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}